90.3A member or a senior appointed officer does not have a conflict of interest and does not violate section 90.8 by reason only that he or a family associate is, as the case may be,

(a)
a qualified voter, an owner-occupier of residential property, or a user of any public utility service supplied to him by the municipality or local board in like manner and subject to like conditions as are applicable in the case of persons who are not members;

